    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thats a bit of a bummer if u ask me. it sounds like u're saying the tech is more trouble than it's worth though. if the crime solving benefits are \"overstated\" and the risks are \"outweighing\" the good, aren't we basically just saying we shouldn't use it at all? is there even a version of this where it's actually a good thing for a city?",
